<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Word received is life and Spirit.</l><l>Our spirit we must exercise</l><l>To receive the life embodied in the Word.</l><l>Read, eat, breathe, everyday;</l><l>To take God in His Word is necessary.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Word we speak is the Lord Jesus,</l><l>Him who we’ve known, we testify,</l><l>Building up the church as prophesied.</l><l>As we speak, Satan flees;</l><l>Speaking God defeats the enemy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
